# ============================================================
# GSE145477 (bone marrow mesenchymal lineage / MALP paper) – Seurat v5 pipeline
# Windows-safe, self-contained matrix .txt.gz (gene column + barcode header)
#
# GOAL:
#   - Integrate ages (1M, 1.5M, 3M, 16M)
#   - Cluster + UMAP
#   - IMPROVED annotation:
#       (A) Broad compartment call (Mesenchymal vs Endothelial vs Mural vs Hematopoietic)
#       (B) Refined subtype call within each compartment
#   - Klb expression plots + summary tables
#
# NOTE ON kNN before UMAP:
#   - FindNeighbors is REQUIRED for graph clustering (FindClusters).
#   - UMAP itself can run without FindNeighbors, but in Seurat we typically do:
#       PCA -> FindNeighbors -> FindClusters -> RunUMAP
#     so UMAP and clusters reflect the same neighborhood structure.
# ============================================================

